# the Live pages' settings are the player's, saved with the project: Snap (CHORDS' KNOB 1), the chords' Keys (a SEL
# tap: Q), the arp's Tempo (ARP's KNOB 1). Stopped, they save by themselves once settled; after a restart they're as
# left, on the PLAY page.
expect snap 50
expect keys 0
expect arp_bpm 90
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 -6
expect snap 20
tap SEL
expect keys 1
turn SELECT 1
expect kpage 2
turn K1 10
expect arp_bpm 100
wait 8000
expect store_writes 1
reboot
wait 500
expect snap 20
expect keys 1
expect arp_bpm 100
expect kpage 0
